            "formal": "Let S = (s_1, s_2, ..., s_k) be a sequence of distinct nodes such that (s_i, s_{i+1}) are edges for i=1..k-1 and (s_k, s_1) is an edge. Among all such sequences (cyclic shifts and reversals), S is lexicographically smallest."
